        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 1,
          "text": "D-400 Schedule PN 2021 Part-Year Resident and Nonresident Schedule"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "DOR\nUse\nOnly"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "**If you enter a taxable percentage on Form D-400, Line 13 because you or your spouse, if married filing jointly, were not full-year residents of North Carolina during tax year 2021, you must attach this schedule to Form D-400. Importantly, you must attach both pages of this schedule to Form D-400. If you do not, the Department may be unable to process your return.**"
        },
        {
          "type": "form",
          "fields": [
            {
              "label": "Last Name (First 10 Characters)",
              "field_type": "text",
              "position": "middle-left"
            },
            {
              "label": "Your Social Security Number",
              "field_type": "text",
              "position": "middle-right"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "**Do not send a photocopy of this form.**\n**Print in Black or Blue Ink Only. No Pencil or Red Ink.**"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "A part-year resident or a nonresident who receives income from N.C. sources must complete this form to determine the percentage of total income from all sources that is subject to N.C. tax. You are a **“part-year resident”** if you moved to N.C. and became a resident during the tax year, or you moved out of N.C. and became a resident of another state during the tax year. You are a **“nonresident”** if you were not a resident of N.C. at any time during the tax year."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "**Important: Refer to the Instructions before completing this form.**"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Part A. Residency Status"
        },
        {
          "type": "form",
          "fields": [
            {
              "label": "Taxpayer is:",
              "field_type": "radio",
              "options": [
                "Full-Year Resident",
                "Nonresident",
                "Part-Year Resident"
              ],
              "position": "middle-left"
            },
            {
              "label": "Taxpayer Date N.C. residency began",
              "field_type": "date",
              "position": "middle-left"
            },
            {
              "label": "Taxpayer Date N.C. residency ended",
              "field_type": "date",
              "position": "middle-left"
            },
            {
              "label": "Spouse is:",
              "field_type": "radio",
              "options": [
                "Full-Year Resident",
                "Nonresident",
                "Part-Year Resident"
              ],
              "position": "middle-right"
            },
            {
              "label": "Spouse Date N.C. residency began",
              "field_type": "date",
              "position": "middle-right"
            },
            {
              "label": "Spouse Date N.C. residency ended",
              "field_type": "date",
              "position": "middle-right"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "*If you and your spouse were both full-year residents of N.C., **stop here**; do not complete Parts B and C. Do not attach Schedule PN to Form D-400.*"
